// `sqlite`: SQLite 3 through the system `libsqlite3`.
//
// - `sqlite.database`: `Database`, a connection (a file or in memory) with
//   `execute` and `query`, parameters bound by position or name, and rows
//   decoded through `FromData`; `Transaction`, a resource that commits on
//   `commit` and rolls back when it closes otherwise.
// - `sqlite.error`: `SqliteError` and `SqliteErrorKind`, what failed, with
//   SQLite's message.
//
// `pkg.sys` holds the generated `extern "C"` modules (`anvil ffi gen`) and
// the hand-written `pkg.sys.hand`; they stay inside this package. Each
// module holds its own tests; `pkg.tests` holds the SQL features end to end.
